WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:10.010
[theme music]

00:21.021 --> 00:23.106
[Mango] My arm!
[groans]

00:23.189 --> 00:25.358
[groaning continues]

00:25.900 --> 00:27.569
What is this all of a sudden?

00:27.652 --> 00:28.862
She won't slow us down.

00:28.945 --> 00:30.030
Stand up, asshole, okay?

00:30.113 --> 00:32.240
- Hey there, Mango.
- [Mango groans]

00:32.323 --> 00:34.159
[Pildo] Answer me this, having a good day?

00:34.242 --> 00:35.577
[Mango's subordinate] That hurts. Oh.

00:35.660 --> 00:36.911
What are you doing?

00:37.620 --> 00:38.747
She is my partner.

00:39.414 --> 00:40.415
Let go.

00:44.210 --> 00:45.211
Let go of him.

00:45.754 --> 00:46.921
[Mango groans]

00:48.131 --> 00:49.507
[Mango] Goddamn it.

00:49.591 --> 00:50.925
[groans]

00:51.009 --> 00:52.385
Hey, watch your mouth.

00:52.469 --> 00:54.596
My partner was just saying hello to you.

00:57.974 --> 00:58.808
You're brave…

01:01.102 --> 01:02.353
but you need more skills.

01:04.147 --> 01:06.149
[breathing heavily]
Mm.

01:08.276 --> 01:09.819
- [Mango] What are you doing?
- [glass clinks]

01:11.279 --> 01:12.447
You got a warrant?

01:13.573 --> 01:15.492
Uh, no. I don't have one.

01:16.284 --> 01:17.368
[Pildo scoffs]

01:17.452 --> 01:20.705
Well, you've known
for having tiny balls, Mango,

01:21.247 --> 01:23.917
but you attack a cop and demand a warrant.

01:24.000 --> 01:26.961
You're going overboard
so the drugs are here, right?

01:28.797 --> 01:29.839
What do you mean?

01:29.923 --> 01:31.508
[stutters]
What, what drugs are you talking about?

01:31.591 --> 01:34.344
[chuckles]
Wow, you're stuttering. How cute.

01:34.969 --> 01:36.262
You know.

01:36.805 --> 01:38.181
The small ones…

01:38.264 --> 01:40.016
The black ones…

01:40.600 --> 01:42.727
[Daesoo] Who does this money
belong to, huh?

01:42.811 --> 01:44.437
Shall we talk to the people inside?

01:44.521 --> 01:46.064
I wonder how much they are gambling.

01:46.147 --> 01:47.357
Wait, hold on!

01:48.233 --> 01:49.442
You, don't move.

01:51.277 --> 01:52.946
You can't even handle this.

01:53.530 --> 01:56.074
[Mango] Hang on, you can't do this
even if you are a cop.

01:56.157 --> 01:58.243
[Daesoo] Yes, I can.
To an asshole like you.

01:58.326 --> 01:59.369
- Come on.
- [gamblers chattering]

01:59.452 --> 02:01.955
- Hey! Everyone, freeze!
- [Mango] Hang on.

02:02.038 --> 02:03.748
[Daesoo] This is the police!

02:03.832 --> 02:07.877
Leave all the money on the table
and show me some ID's!

02:07.961 --> 02:09.045
ID's out!

02:09.129 --> 02:11.506
[Daesoo laughs]
You're all getting busted.

02:11.589 --> 02:14.050
- Get your ID's out.
- [Mango] Detective.

02:14.634 --> 02:16.219
[shouts]
Detective Jeon Pildo!

02:17.470 --> 02:19.556
Why are you doing this?

02:19.639 --> 02:20.473
Why?

02:20.557 --> 02:22.350
Where are the drugs?

02:23.434 --> 02:26.187
Oh, man, what drug are you talking about?
[chuckles]

02:27.105 --> 02:29.440
We don't even have Tylenol here.

02:29.524 --> 02:31.693
Ah, didn't you hide it here last time?

02:34.237 --> 02:37.031
Right, you hid it up there
last time too, yeah?

02:37.115 --> 02:38.324
It was high up.

02:38.408 --> 02:40.702
- You runt. Let's go.
- [Mango scoffs]

02:40.785 --> 02:43.329
Hey, now, this isn't a pharmacy.

02:43.413 --> 02:45.081
[Pildo] I can't even reach up here.

02:45.165 --> 02:46.416
There's nothing up there!

02:46.499 --> 02:47.834
What are you looking for?

02:47.917 --> 02:49.586
- You little shit.
- Oh, my gosh.

02:49.669 --> 02:50.753
- [Mango] Hey!
- [Jiwoo] Yo!

02:50.837 --> 02:52.422
[Mango] You're obstructing my business.

02:52.505 --> 02:54.591
Huh? I'm the one that needs drugs.

02:56.968 --> 02:58.052
[Mango] What…

02:58.136 --> 02:59.179
[Mango hesitates]
Why…

03:00.388 --> 03:01.931
[in breathy voice]
That fucking bitch.

03:02.015 --> 03:04.809
[bottles clinking]

03:07.729 --> 03:08.897
[rattles]

03:10.481 --> 03:12.150
[rattling]

03:14.819 --> 03:15.987
[pills clattering]

03:17.155 --> 03:19.532
[clattering continues]

03:20.700 --> 03:22.577
Shit. She found it.

03:22.660 --> 03:23.995
- Oh, yeah.
- Yeah.

03:24.078 --> 03:25.246
Get over here, you asshole.

03:25.330 --> 03:27.040
- Uh… Hold on.
- Come on now. Look here.

03:27.707 --> 03:29.167
[Pildo] Asshole.

03:29.250 --> 03:30.835
[Mango] I'm so screwed.

03:31.544 --> 03:33.713
[suspenseful music]

03:34.964 --> 03:37.675
Take, take it easy. I'm injured right now.

03:37.759 --> 03:40.053
- [Mango groans]
- Come on!

03:41.304 --> 03:42.305
[Mango] Ah!

03:44.349 --> 03:45.683
Oh, shit.

03:46.601 --> 03:47.644
[engine starts]

03:47.727 --> 03:49.812
Hey, so… I'm talking right now!

03:49.896 --> 03:53.233
I said to bring Mango out,
not beat everyone.

03:53.816 --> 03:55.193
They wouldn't listen to me.

03:55.818 --> 03:58.404
It wasn't because you wanted to show me
how tough you are?

04:01.866 --> 04:04.160
Didn't you wanna test
what I was capable of?

04:06.496 --> 04:07.747
[Pildo] Don't do that again.

04:11.042 --> 04:13.127
What you're wearing
isn't even bulletproof.

04:13.962 --> 04:16.422
This isn't Violent Crimes, you know.

04:17.924 --> 04:19.133
Yeah, I get it.

04:21.261 --> 04:22.637
[car door opens, closes]

04:23.554 --> 04:25.306
- [drugs rattle]
- Where did you get this?

04:25.390 --> 04:26.599
[door closes]

04:27.767 --> 04:29.936
Detective Oh isn't a complete flake.

04:30.019 --> 04:32.188
[Mango] It was just a gift. Yeah.

04:32.272 --> 04:34.190
It's just a sample I was given.

04:35.149 --> 04:37.068
[Pildo] Exactly. Who gave it to you?

04:37.151 --> 04:38.486
[sighs]

04:39.737 --> 04:40.780
Shit.

04:45.618 --> 04:47.745
- Send it to NFS.
- Sir.

04:50.540 --> 04:51.582
So, Mango.

04:52.875 --> 04:55.086
How many years will you get this time?

04:55.837 --> 04:58.089
Are you besties with the drug dealer?

04:58.172 --> 04:59.924
Shit. Goddamn it.

05:02.844 --> 05:04.053
[sighs]

05:06.055 --> 05:07.640
This guy is…

05:08.766 --> 05:10.601
really scary.

05:16.107 --> 05:19.944
[upbeat music playing]

05:24.365 --> 05:27.160
[Gangjae] Why did the gods create drugs?

05:29.454 --> 05:31.289
They open Pandora's box.

05:31.956 --> 05:34.459
The last sliver of hope?

05:35.209 --> 05:36.544
I don't think so.

05:38.129 --> 05:39.339
Drugs.

05:39.422 --> 05:40.506
[Gangjae chuckles]

05:41.507 --> 05:44.844
War, death, poverty, disease.

05:44.927 --> 05:46.763
Why must we endure these hardships?

05:46.846 --> 05:48.056
- Forget them.
- [whistles]

05:51.225 --> 05:53.061
If you put this in your mouth,

05:53.144 --> 05:56.189
your fears disappear
and you become a superhero.

05:57.231 --> 05:59.650
Not a trace left in your body.

06:00.151 --> 06:02.612
It's a gift from the gods.

06:05.156 --> 06:06.908
[middle-aged man]
That's an enticing offer.

06:07.492 --> 06:10.578
But, uh, Choi Mujin won't stand for it.

06:12.789 --> 06:15.541
[Gangjae] Meth is a thing of the past now.

06:16.584 --> 06:19.128
[gulping]

06:24.342 --> 06:26.719
Go out and get yourselves a black suit.

06:28.179 --> 06:29.889
Get ready for a funeral.

06:33.393 --> 06:34.769
[Jiwoo] Mango was arrested.

06:36.020 --> 06:37.021
He was?

06:37.730 --> 06:39.732
He had a new kind of drug.

06:39.816 --> 06:41.567
That's what Narcotics is looking for.

06:42.568 --> 06:44.070
And where is it from?

06:44.654 --> 06:45.780
[Jiwoo] I don't know yet.

06:46.364 --> 06:47.657
I'll figure it out.

06:47.740 --> 06:48.825
[Mujin] Okay then.

06:50.743 --> 06:51.994
[intercom beeps]

06:52.078 --> 06:53.538
Call in Mr. Jung.

07:01.170 --> 07:02.755
I registered you into the system.

07:04.632 --> 07:05.508
[Jiwoo] Oh.

07:06.134 --> 07:07.176
Thanks.

07:12.181 --> 07:13.224
[mouse clicks]

07:13.933 --> 07:15.560
INCHANG METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

07:15.643 --> 07:16.853
DATABASE

07:17.437 --> 07:18.479
[mouse clicks]

07:19.605 --> 07:21.732
[keyboard clacking]

07:22.275 --> 07:24.569
2016 DONGCHEON YOON DONGHOON

07:24.652 --> 07:25.570
[mouse clicks]

07:30.450 --> 07:31.576
MURDER OF DONGCHEON'S
HEAD OF OPERATIONS

07:31.659 --> 07:32.577
YOON DONGHOON

07:37.748 --> 07:39.292
UNIDENTIFIED MAN IN BLACK HOODIE
ENTERING APARTMENT

07:40.001 --> 07:41.752
JUNG TAEJU WAS WITH YOON DONGHOON

07:41.836 --> 07:43.713
AT THE FINAL LOCATION BEFORE HIS DEATH

07:43.796 --> 07:47.091
[upbeat music]

07:49.010 --> 07:50.678
[Mujin] Donghoon's killer is a policeman.

07:50.761 --> 07:52.972
IDENTICAL TO THE POLICE ISSUE MODEL

07:53.055 --> 07:54.474
NATIONAL FORENSIC SERVICE
BULLET 1

07:54.557 --> 07:55.850
[gunshots]

07:55.933 --> 07:57.143
ON THE DAY OF YOON DONGHOON'S DEATH,

07:57.226 --> 07:58.603
LIEUTENANT CHA GIHO
AND CORPORAL KIM TAEUK

07:58.686 --> 08:01.898
WERE AT AN OPERATION TO CAPTURE
DRUG PRODUCER BAE JUNGOO

08:01.981 --> 08:04.525
[upbeat music]

08:08.488 --> 08:10.031
[Gunpyeong] Would you like some coffee?

08:11.240 --> 08:12.158
Mm-hmm.

08:16.287 --> 08:17.580
- [door lock beeps]
- [door opens]

08:20.458 --> 08:22.710
[solemn music]

08:24.504 --> 08:25.379
[door lock beeps]

08:30.426 --> 08:31.594
You haven't gone home?

08:32.637 --> 08:33.638
No.

08:36.182 --> 08:38.684
[door opens, closes]

09:06.128 --> 09:07.505
I hear that there's a new drug.

09:08.506 --> 09:09.423
Yes, sir.

09:10.007 --> 09:10.967
I've heard rumors.

09:14.387 --> 09:17.223
Because of Mr. Bae, for three weeks,
we couldn't supply drugs.

09:17.974 --> 09:20.184
During that time,
was the new drug ring formed?

09:20.268 --> 09:21.936
I can look into it now, sir.

09:22.019 --> 09:22.979
[Mujin] There's no need.

09:24.313 --> 09:25.565
Jiwoo will find it.

09:29.485 --> 09:32.071
I'VE ARRIVED IN TOKYO. YOU MUST MEET
DEADLINES ONCE THE DEAL IS MADE.

09:33.573 --> 09:34.699
And the factory?

09:34.782 --> 09:36.450
Yes, we have obtained it, sir.

09:36.534 --> 09:38.286
- [Mujin] Where?
- The North Port.

09:41.789 --> 09:43.249
I'll go myself and check.

09:44.584 --> 09:46.586
[gentle music]

09:50.506 --> 09:51.549
[Ms. Kang in Japanese]
Nice to meet you.

09:51.632 --> 09:53.884
I am Kang Sooyeon.

09:55.094 --> 09:59.432
Our chairman
would have come personally, but…

10:02.435 --> 10:05.479
Then, shall we get to business?

10:21.871 --> 10:25.041
It's the best quality product
on the market right now.

10:25.708 --> 10:30.338
We call them "Diamonds".

10:30.421 --> 10:31.547
[device beeps]

10:32.048 --> 10:33.549
[man in Japanese]
It is of top quality.

10:37.303 --> 10:38.846
[Yamamoto exhales]

10:40.139 --> 10:42.516
[sucks teeth]

10:43.309 --> 10:45.478
[exhales deeply]

10:46.437 --> 10:48.064
[in Japanese]
We'll take them.

10:48.147 --> 10:50.608
Bring the goods here in ten days.

10:50.691 --> 10:52.985
[Ms. Kang in Japanese]
Yes, sir. Understood.

10:57.698 --> 11:00.326
[birds chirping]

11:09.377 --> 11:10.503
[clicks]

11:12.171 --> 11:13.255
[drawer thuds]

11:19.595 --> 11:22.431
[Daesoo] Dang it. Carbs make me fat,
but they taste so good.

11:22.515 --> 11:25.643
All food is fattening
when you're old, man.

11:25.726 --> 11:27.937
[Daesoo] You, jerk. So you don't want it?

11:28.020 --> 11:29.397
Ah, you lost.

11:29.897 --> 11:31.524
- [groans]
- [plastic rustling]

11:31.607 --> 11:33.734
- Here you are, Detective Oh.
- Thank you.

11:35.444 --> 11:37.363
Detective Ko Gunpyeong.

11:39.990 --> 11:40.825
This one? Hm.

11:43.994 --> 11:45.913
We're not questioning Mango anymore?

11:45.996 --> 11:48.541
He has intel, so we have to keep him
locked up for now.

11:48.624 --> 11:50.543
He'll talk if we don't give him attention.

11:51.460 --> 11:52.962
What about investigating?

11:53.546 --> 11:54.588
[Pildo] Hey.

11:56.090 --> 11:58.342
What is the first quality of a good cop?

12:00.136 --> 12:03.305
For Narcotics, wouldn't it be information?

12:03.389 --> 12:04.390
That's wrong.

12:04.473 --> 12:05.641
It's patience.

12:06.517 --> 12:09.103
If you can wait, you'll catch them.

12:10.521 --> 12:11.480
Go eat.

12:13.149 --> 12:14.316
[Pildo clears throat]

12:21.240 --> 12:24.910
INCHANG METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

12:24.994 --> 12:27.621
- [siren wailing in distance]
- [indistinct chatter]

12:33.961 --> 12:34.879
[knocks on door]

12:39.258 --> 12:41.343
[Gunpyeong]
Captain. The target's on the move.

12:42.428 --> 12:43.637
[Cha Giho] Let's go.

12:45.723 --> 12:46.766
Call for backup.

12:46.849 --> 12:47.850
[Daesoo] Sir.

12:47.933 --> 12:48.893
[door lock beeps]

12:48.976 --> 12:50.936
- [Pildo] Let's go.
- [Daesoo] Come on. We're heading out.

12:52.855 --> 12:55.024
[weapons hold officer] Number 20K70637.

12:55.107 --> 12:56.150
Corporal Oh Hyejin.

12:59.069 --> 13:00.112
[Pildo] Okay.

13:02.114 --> 13:04.658
[indistinct chatter]

13:07.828 --> 13:09.663
So, remove your cell phones.

13:12.958 --> 13:15.461
[cell phones chiming]

13:24.094 --> 13:24.929
Tonight,

13:26.388 --> 13:27.932
our target is…

13:28.015 --> 13:29.016
[beeps]

13:32.728 --> 13:34.188
…Choi Mujin.

13:34.271 --> 13:36.273
[suspenseful music]

13:44.281 --> 13:45.658
[Cha Giho] Choi Mujin.

13:46.534 --> 13:48.452
He's the owner of Hotel Liber.

13:48.536 --> 13:51.580
He's the leader of the largest drug ring
in our country Dongcheon.

13:51.664 --> 13:54.333
They sell 90 percent of methamphetamine.

13:55.042 --> 13:59.255
Bae Jungoo, their middle man, the CEO
of a shipping firm, committed suicide.

13:59.338 --> 14:02.883
But a ship owned by Bae
arrived from Thailand two days ago.

14:02.967 --> 14:04.760
Choi Mujin took over that factory.

14:06.303 --> 14:08.305
North Port Section K.

14:09.890 --> 14:12.351
Choi Mujin will arrive in 50 minutes.

14:12.434 --> 14:14.895
Narcotics Teams Alpha and Beta
will go inside.

14:14.979 --> 14:16.105
The rest will back them up.

14:16.188 --> 14:17.731
HOTEL LIBER CHOI MUJIN, MONITOR 1

14:21.610 --> 14:23.237
Focus on this one man.

14:24.488 --> 14:26.365
[Cha Giho] We must arrest Choi Mujin.

14:26.448 --> 14:27.616
Do you understand?

14:28.242 --> 14:29.326
[cops] Yes, sir.

14:29.827 --> 14:31.078
Move out.

14:31.829 --> 14:34.582
[suspenseful music]

14:36.166 --> 14:37.167
[Pildo] Let's go.

14:52.141 --> 14:53.517
[Gunpyeong] Here's your body cam.

14:54.226 --> 14:56.103
- [Daesoo] Back up your data.
- [cop] I will.

14:56.645 --> 14:57.688
[Cha Giho] Hey.

14:58.647 --> 15:01.817
Make sure we get Choi Mujin
and the evidence. Okay?

15:01.901 --> 15:03.319
[Narcotics team] Yes, sir.

15:04.320 --> 15:06.322
Don't you be nervous. Got it?

15:13.412 --> 15:15.414
[suspenseful music rises]

15:38.729 --> 15:40.814
We're going radio silent now.

16:12.012 --> 16:13.097
[radio feedback]

16:13.180 --> 16:15.099
Hold positions and standby.

16:15.683 --> 16:18.060
[machine hissing]

16:18.143 --> 16:19.520
[Taeju] Thank you for coming here.

16:21.689 --> 16:23.732
- Is that the workshop?
- Yes.

16:23.816 --> 16:26.986
We get materials in Thailand,
and we manufacture at sea.

16:27.069 --> 16:28.612
Please come this way.

16:34.952 --> 16:37.287
[tense music]

16:46.171 --> 16:47.214
[radio beeps]

16:47.297 --> 16:48.632
[Pildo] One, in position.

16:49.133 --> 16:50.968
[officer 1] Two, in position.
Choi Mujin is confirmed.

16:52.886 --> 16:53.971
Infiltrate.

17:08.193 --> 17:10.529
[suspenseful music]

17:15.617 --> 17:16.744
[groans]

17:19.246 --> 17:21.415
[Pildo breathing heavily]

17:30.340 --> 17:32.217
[suspenseful music continues]

17:45.981 --> 17:48.150
[machines whirring]

18:02.956 --> 18:05.209
[loud thudding]

18:06.752 --> 18:08.295
[mumbling]

18:13.634 --> 18:16.553
[crewmen muttering]

18:24.228 --> 18:25.646
- [steam hisses]
- [crewmen clamor]

18:25.729 --> 18:26.647
[Daesoo] Get him!

18:27.231 --> 18:29.149
Get him! Don't let him get away!

18:29.775 --> 18:32.027
[tense music]

18:44.039 --> 18:46.250
[grunting]

18:59.346 --> 19:00.722
They look like the crew.

19:00.806 --> 19:02.724
They claim they don't know
about the drugs.

19:02.808 --> 19:03.892
Keep going.

19:03.976 --> 19:04.935
[Daesoo] We're going in.

19:05.769 --> 19:07.437
- [pounding]
- [burbling]

19:17.781 --> 19:20.701
[distant thudding]

19:32.296 --> 19:34.339
[ominous music]

19:34.423 --> 19:35.382
[phone chimes]

19:39.219 --> 19:41.221
[tense music]

19:57.988 --> 20:00.240
[Cha Giho] Remember,
the target is Choi Mujin.

20:00.324 --> 20:01.909
We need evidence.

20:07.664 --> 20:09.583
[gangster 1 whistling]

20:15.631 --> 20:17.674
[both grunting]

20:20.761 --> 20:22.054
[gangster 2 grunts]

20:23.597 --> 20:24.932
What's going on?

20:25.432 --> 20:27.726
- [Cha Giho] Hey, Pildo! Pildo!
- [grunts]

20:27.809 --> 20:29.937
[Cha Giho] Listen up,
there's a situation with Pildo.

20:30.020 --> 20:32.397
Team Two, move to Team One now. Hurry up!

20:32.940 --> 20:34.942
[Taeju] Now, we won't be short
on our supply.

20:36.360 --> 20:37.694
Seems Mr. Bae was smart.

20:42.616 --> 20:44.243
Yamamoto's goods are ready.

20:44.326 --> 20:45.327
[Taeju] Sir.

20:46.328 --> 20:48.789
[suspenseful music]

21:16.066 --> 21:18.068
[distant thudding]

21:29.871 --> 21:31.373
[Pildo] Choi Mujin, put your hands up!

21:33.292 --> 21:34.626
[Taeju] Put that down!

21:35.377 --> 21:36.586
[Pildo] No, stop!

21:36.670 --> 21:40.173
Choi Mujin, you're under arrest
for the manufacture of illegal drugs.

21:40.716 --> 21:42.009
- Don't, Jung Taeju!
- [gunshot]

21:42.092 --> 21:44.553
- [gunshot]
- [electricity powering down]

21:44.636 --> 21:46.596
Are you okay? Who fired that shot?

21:47.514 --> 21:49.683
- [fire alarm blaring]
- [fire crackling]

21:51.435 --> 21:53.562
[Cha Giho] Hey, Pildo. Pildo!

21:53.645 --> 21:54.896
[Pildo] Freeze, Choi Mujin!

21:56.940 --> 21:58.608
[drug chemists screaming]

22:01.445 --> 22:02.487
[Cha Giho] Get Choi Mujin.

22:02.571 --> 22:04.281
Don't let him get away!

22:05.282 --> 22:06.992
Freeze, Choi Mujin!

22:07.075 --> 22:08.577
[drug chemists scream]

22:13.415 --> 22:16.001
[tense music]

22:21.173 --> 22:23.258
[Pildo] That's Choi Mujin, damnit.
He's getting away.

22:23.342 --> 22:25.510
[drug chemists scream]

22:29.306 --> 22:30.974
[loud bang]

22:31.058 --> 22:32.726
[explosion]

22:32.809 --> 22:33.852
Damn it! Let's go!

22:42.819 --> 22:44.529
- [Pildo] Where's Choi Mujin?
- [officer 2] Choi Mujin?

22:44.613 --> 22:46.073
- [Pildo] We have to find him.
- [officer 2] He was here?

22:46.156 --> 22:47.449
- [Pildo] Find Choi Mujin!
- [officer 2] Let's find him. Come on!

22:48.033 --> 22:50.035
[suspenseful music]

23:00.128 --> 23:02.047
[thrilling music]

23:04.966 --> 23:06.593
[splashes]

23:08.512 --> 23:11.681
[helicopter blades whirring]

23:18.230 --> 23:19.272
Find him?

23:21.733 --> 23:22.692
- [Cha Giho] You.
- [officer 3] Yes?

23:22.776 --> 23:24.069
Go check the inside of the ship again.

23:24.152 --> 23:25.028
Yes, sir.

23:30.909 --> 23:32.327
Did you see who fired?

23:34.246 --> 23:35.414
- [Pildo] Damn!
- [thuds]

23:42.546 --> 23:45.674
[Daesoo] Damn it. With that crack,
we can't even use it as evidence.

23:49.094 --> 23:50.178
- [officer 3] Captain.
- Huh?

23:50.262 --> 23:51.179
[officer 3] This is it.

24:08.155 --> 24:09.448
[Cha Giho coughs]

24:21.084 --> 24:22.002
[camera shutter clicks]

24:31.303 --> 24:32.888
These are crazy people.

24:32.971 --> 24:35.140
[camera shutter clicking]

24:35.223 --> 24:37.058
[bullets clinking]

24:38.977 --> 24:39.936
[sighs]

24:41.521 --> 24:42.647
[Jiwoo] Captain.

25:17.557 --> 25:18.642
Shit!

25:18.725 --> 25:20.727
[breathing heavily]

25:35.951 --> 25:37.577
- Shit!
- [glass shatters]

25:38.537 --> 25:39.579
[breathes hard]

25:40.288 --> 25:42.958
Cha Giho was after us.
[pants]

25:43.041 --> 25:44.251
We didn't realize it sooner

25:44.334 --> 25:45.585
- because they--
- Taeju.

25:45.669 --> 25:48.588
[breathing heavily]

25:48.672 --> 25:49.756
Who are we?

25:51.508 --> 25:53.677
Did you forget who we are
because we wear designer suits

25:53.760 --> 25:54.970
and have fancy titles?

25:55.053 --> 25:56.930
[breathes deeply]

25:57.013 --> 25:58.098
I'm sorry.

26:00.642 --> 26:02.435
Find who is sneaking our information.

26:03.270 --> 26:05.188
- [Taeju] Yes, sir.
- [pants]

26:06.398 --> 26:07.440
But…

26:09.568 --> 26:11.278
why didn't Jiwoo contact us?

26:16.032 --> 26:18.034
[breathes heavily]

26:26.501 --> 26:28.420
[Captain Lee] We checked,
and no one from our team

26:28.503 --> 26:29.796
discharged their weapon.

26:30.839 --> 26:31.798
Really?

26:33.508 --> 26:34.509
[sighs]

26:35.093 --> 26:36.845
Well, good work today, Captain Lee.

26:37.929 --> 26:38.930
[phone thuds]

26:41.141 --> 26:42.058
[sighs]

26:46.021 --> 26:48.356
INCHANG METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

26:48.440 --> 26:50.483
[siren wailing]

27:01.953 --> 27:03.705
[line ringing]

27:03.788 --> 27:05.999
[automated voice]
The person you reached is not available.

27:06.082 --> 27:07.959
Please leave a message after the tone.

27:19.888 --> 27:21.973
[phone ringing]

27:35.612 --> 27:39.282
INCOMING CALL

27:41.076 --> 27:43.411
[phone ringing continues]

27:47.916 --> 27:49.459
[line ringing]

27:52.170 --> 27:54.172
CALLING…

27:54.255 --> 27:55.507
CALL ENDED

28:02.597 --> 28:03.640
[door closes]

28:03.723 --> 28:05.141
Look at this.

28:05.225 --> 28:06.101
Look.

28:06.643 --> 28:08.853
You and Choi Mujin were talking together.

28:08.937 --> 28:10.063
I saw you.

28:11.189 --> 28:12.774
Choi Mujin was there!

28:14.484 --> 28:16.569
I don't know anything.

28:17.737 --> 28:19.364
Shit. This fucker…

28:20.073 --> 28:21.032
Come on.

28:21.574 --> 28:22.534
Come here.

28:22.617 --> 28:24.828
- Whoa! Whoa! Hey! Stop that!
- Ooh…

28:24.911 --> 28:27.455
- I saw you in there with Choi Mujin.
- [detained criminal groaning]

28:27.539 --> 28:29.165
So, talk. Talk!

28:38.633 --> 28:39.676
[Pildo sighs]

28:40.593 --> 28:42.762
- Take out your guns.
- [Daesoo] What?

28:43.722 --> 28:44.723
What…

28:52.397 --> 28:54.941
Captain. Wait. Do you suspect us?

28:56.568 --> 28:58.194
- Hey, Captain.
- [exhales deeply]

29:00.822 --> 29:01.906
[sighs]

29:03.241 --> 29:05.326
[Daesoo] Captain. It wasn't us.

29:21.259 --> 29:22.385
[sighs]

29:28.099 --> 29:29.142
Put them away.

29:32.729 --> 29:34.105
[Daesoo] What the hell is going on?

29:35.398 --> 29:36.858
Ah, shit.

29:39.736 --> 29:40.987
[loud thud]

29:42.906 --> 29:44.199
Damn it.

29:44.282 --> 29:46.409
Were Park Changoo and Mango
just fake outs?

29:48.953 --> 29:51.790
We booked the small fries and waited
for Choi Mujin to let his guard down.

29:51.873 --> 29:54.167
So he was the actual target
all along then.

29:54.250 --> 29:56.002
We have to catch him in the act!

29:59.130 --> 29:59.964
[sighs]

30:02.592 --> 30:04.844
[whirring]

30:04.928 --> 30:05.804
[tense music]

30:05.887 --> 30:07.138
[Pildo] Choi Mujin.

30:07.222 --> 30:09.808
Became the boss of Dongcheon 12 years ago.

30:09.891 --> 30:11.309
He was suspected of countless crimes

30:11.392 --> 30:13.853
including drug manufacture,
sales, assault,

30:13.937 --> 30:16.231
and murder-for-hire,
but he was never indicted.

30:16.815 --> 30:20.193
We never had enough evidence
and others always confessed for him.

30:26.282 --> 30:27.700
YOON DONGHOON
DIED IN 2016

30:31.746 --> 30:33.081
[Pildo] Yoon Donghoon.

30:33.164 --> 30:34.749
Choi Mujin's closest friend.

30:34.833 --> 30:36.543
Murdered five years ago.

30:39.838 --> 30:41.673
Do you know who murdered him?

30:41.756 --> 30:42.799
We don't know.

30:43.299 --> 30:44.926
We never found the murder weapon.

30:45.426 --> 30:46.845
- But--
- [commissioner] What happened?

30:54.143 --> 30:56.980
You found no evidence and burned the ship?

30:58.106 --> 30:59.065
Cha Giho.

30:59.566 --> 31:00.984
What are you doing?

31:01.901 --> 31:02.944
Sorry, sir.

31:03.486 --> 31:06.155
I told you not to act on your emotions.

31:06.656 --> 31:08.116
What will you do about this?

31:09.450 --> 31:11.119
We have to catch Choi Mujin.

31:13.037 --> 31:15.206
We have to kill that asshole!

31:16.457 --> 31:17.792
[breathes deeply]

31:22.130 --> 31:23.798
All of you, keep quiet.

31:25.800 --> 31:27.594
If this gets out, we're all dead.

31:34.517 --> 31:35.810
Get it together.

31:40.440 --> 31:42.191
- [door lock beeps]
- [door opens]

31:42.275 --> 31:43.359
[inhales sharply]

31:44.903 --> 31:45.862
[sighs]

31:49.407 --> 31:50.366
[exhales deeply]

31:52.076 --> 31:53.077
[door closes]

32:06.007 --> 32:08.843
[frustrated groan]
Can't we just catch that asshole, huh?

32:11.012 --> 32:13.348
And who fired that shot, huh?

32:14.557 --> 32:15.475
[sighs]

32:16.768 --> 32:18.519
How long have you been after him?

32:19.187 --> 32:22.273
Since before I joined Narcotics, uh,
four years.

32:23.066 --> 32:25.276
Why is Captain after him, specifically?

32:25.360 --> 32:26.361
[Pildo] Why else?

32:26.986 --> 32:29.155
We wanna take the largest drug ring down.

32:31.324 --> 32:33.493
Do you know how much drugs
Dongcheon distributes yearly?

32:34.744 --> 32:36.454
Yeah, but it's personal.

32:40.041 --> 32:43.127
A while back, the youngest member
of Narcotics died.

32:43.211 --> 32:46.130
[Daesoo] I think it was around 2004
or something…

33:07.485 --> 33:09.195
So from then until now…

33:09.278 --> 33:10.238
[Daesoo] Yeah.

33:10.321 --> 33:12.073
[Daesoo sighs]
Just imagine…

33:13.074 --> 33:15.368
how the Captain must feel right now, yeah?

33:18.121 --> 33:19.163
[sighs]

33:19.247 --> 33:20.415
What do we do now?

33:20.999 --> 33:22.208
What else can we do?

33:23.209 --> 33:24.460
We try again.

33:26.045 --> 33:27.922
Until the Dongcheon assholes are all gone.

33:28.006 --> 33:29.090
[bottle thuds]

33:30.299 --> 33:31.259
Here.

33:32.343 --> 33:34.178
How are you so chill, hmm?

33:36.347 --> 33:38.307
[Gunpyeong] Oh, Junho. Over here.

33:39.475 --> 33:40.309
Junho.

33:40.393 --> 33:41.519
[Daesoo] What? Junho's here?

33:41.602 --> 33:42.562
- [Junho] Hey there.
- [Daesoo] Huh?

33:42.645 --> 33:44.731
- I need to make a phone call.
- [Daesoo] Oh, okay.

33:44.814 --> 33:45.732
[Pildo] Sit down.

33:45.815 --> 33:47.900
- [Daesoo] Hey, kid. You okay?
- [Junho] Oh, yeah.

33:47.984 --> 33:49.736
[chuckles]
I'm glad you came.

33:49.819 --> 33:50.987
- [Junho] Yeah…
- [Daesoo] Another glass, please!

33:51.863 --> 33:53.197
[Junho] That looks good.

33:53.281 --> 33:54.407
[Daesoo] Yeah. Eat up!

33:54.490 --> 33:55.742
[indistinct chatter]

33:59.203 --> 34:00.288
Are you okay?

34:04.459 --> 34:06.836
[Jiwoo] It was a raid,
I didn't know in advance.

34:08.171 --> 34:09.380
Do I have a tail?

34:10.173 --> 34:11.090
No.

34:14.052 --> 34:16.095
[Jiwoo] The hotel has cameras.

34:16.179 --> 34:18.056
And the hallway in front of the penthouse.

34:18.139 --> 34:20.558
The basement elevator entrance.
The garage exit.

34:20.641 --> 34:23.394
There are three cameras in those places.

34:26.481 --> 34:28.524
Which means someone is a mole.

34:29.942 --> 34:31.152
I'll find out.

34:34.030 --> 34:35.573
[Mujin] Did you shoot the gun?

34:37.450 --> 34:39.285
[Jiwoo] I had no way of contacting you.

34:41.496 --> 34:42.872
But I want you to know I…

34:46.042 --> 34:48.419
decided to use the gun at the crime scene.

34:50.713 --> 34:52.423
[Jiwoo] The truth will get out now…

34:52.965 --> 34:53.966
[gunshot]

34:54.050 --> 34:55.676
[electricity crackling]

34:55.760 --> 34:57.386
…since I left the gun.

35:04.685 --> 35:06.896
[solemn music]

35:34.423 --> 35:35.550
[Daesoo] You know Junho?

35:35.633 --> 35:37.343
You sent him on vacation.
[chuckles]

35:37.426 --> 35:39.137
We'll get you working again.
Don't worry about it.

35:39.220 --> 35:40.555
We'll all work together once you return.

35:40.638 --> 35:41.973
- Right?
- [Junho] Yeah.

35:42.056 --> 35:43.307
[Daesoo] Let's drink.

35:43.391 --> 35:44.475
You punks.

35:45.059 --> 35:46.769
- Cheers.
- Cheers!

35:49.647 --> 35:51.649
[slow upbeat music]

36:15.006 --> 36:16.048
What?

36:16.591 --> 36:18.843
[keyboard clacking]

36:19.635 --> 36:20.511
Daesoo.

36:20.595 --> 36:21.554
What?

36:22.430 --> 36:23.431
What?

36:24.390 --> 36:25.349
Hey.

36:26.058 --> 36:27.059
What's this?

36:30.479 --> 36:31.898
- What's going on?
- Ah…

36:31.981 --> 36:33.608
Shit. Goddamn it.

36:40.448 --> 36:42.366
- We've been compromised.
- Shit.

36:44.202 --> 36:45.286
[sighs]

36:50.625 --> 36:51.834
[crackles]

36:57.048 --> 36:59.425
[slow upbeat music]

37:32.708 --> 37:34.710
[keys rattling]

37:49.350 --> 37:50.601
- [door lock beeps]
- [door opens]

37:53.354 --> 37:55.898
[upbeat music playing]

37:58.526 --> 37:59.694
[gasps]

38:04.198 --> 38:06.325
[wheezing]

38:07.368 --> 38:09.412
[groaning]

38:11.706 --> 38:12.873
Hey!

38:14.333 --> 38:15.543
You ready?

38:16.502 --> 38:19.505
I've been waiting for this for five years,
what do you think?

38:20.715 --> 38:25.177
[both cackling]

38:25.261 --> 38:27.513
[upbeat music continues]

38:35.688 --> 38:39.608
[engine revving]

38:50.828 --> 38:55.082
NATIONAL FORENSIC SERVICE

39:17.563 --> 39:18.481
[car door closes]

39:28.282 --> 39:30.910
[gangsters grunting]

39:34.163 --> 39:36.332
- [gangster] Get out of the way! Watch out!
- [engine revving]

39:37.958 --> 39:39.377
[tires screech]

39:39.460 --> 39:41.587
- [loud thud]
- [indistinct shouting]

39:41.670 --> 39:44.382
[gangsters clamoring]

39:46.801 --> 39:48.594
This place hasn't changed at all.

39:48.677 --> 39:50.763
[indistinct shouting]

39:50.846 --> 39:52.473
[Gangjae] Mr. Jung!

39:53.516 --> 39:54.600
I'm home!

39:56.644 --> 39:57.728
Kill them all.

39:58.229 --> 40:00.439
[grunting]

40:02.066 --> 40:04.693
[indistinct shouting]

40:05.778 --> 40:07.780
- [screams]
- You son of a bitch!

40:11.367 --> 40:13.035
You killing bastard!

40:14.453 --> 40:16.247
[groaning]

40:17.790 --> 40:20.000
[gasping]

40:25.923 --> 40:27.258
Shit!

40:29.301 --> 40:30.678
[yells]

40:32.304 --> 40:34.640
[gangsters clamoring]

40:38.394 --> 40:41.272
[indistinct shouting]

40:53.951 --> 40:55.035
[grunts]

40:56.162 --> 40:58.372
- [sucks teeth]
- [groans]

41:07.965 --> 41:10.134
Stop!

41:10.217 --> 41:12.636
Stop! Stop!

41:13.929 --> 41:16.182
[moaning]

41:17.141 --> 41:20.144
[scoffs]
It's been so long, Taeju.

41:20.227 --> 41:22.354
I thought I should say hi.

41:22.438 --> 41:23.772
[screams]

41:23.856 --> 41:25.774
You asshole.
[breathes hard]

41:25.858 --> 41:26.901
Do you really think--

41:26.984 --> 41:28.903
Hey! Don't be mean.

41:29.945 --> 41:31.155
[groans]

41:31.238 --> 41:32.907
[Gangjae] Now, come on.

41:34.992 --> 41:36.494
Aren't you glad I'm home?

41:38.120 --> 41:39.205
- [grunts]
- [yelps]

41:41.081 --> 41:42.791
Stop it!
[grunts]

41:44.335 --> 41:47.338
[Cheol-Ho] You motherfucker! Goddamn it!

41:47.421 --> 41:49.924
[panting]

41:53.177 --> 41:55.012
"Kill me if you want."

41:56.764 --> 41:58.307
That's how you look.

42:00.434 --> 42:02.311
I won't do it.

42:02.895 --> 42:04.021
So calm down.

42:07.858 --> 42:09.735
[breathes heavily]

42:10.569 --> 42:11.654
Your face.

42:11.737 --> 42:12.905
[Taeju breathes hard]

42:12.988 --> 42:13.906
Leg.

42:13.989 --> 42:15.407
[Taeju breathes hard]

42:15.491 --> 42:16.450
Arm.

42:17.868 --> 42:20.037
Choose which one, I'll hit.

42:20.120 --> 42:22.373
[breathes heavily]

42:22.456 --> 42:24.083
It's typical.

42:27.920 --> 42:29.505
I couldn't choose.

42:29.588 --> 42:31.799
[panting]

42:33.133 --> 42:34.593
[screams]

42:36.178 --> 42:39.014
- [Taeju grunts in pain]
- [sucks teeth]

42:39.098 --> 42:41.976
[inaudible dialog]

42:42.059 --> 42:44.520
THE POWER OF SCIENCE
REVEALS THE TRUTH

42:44.603 --> 42:45.521
[scientist] Thank you.

42:48.524 --> 42:49.525
[Cha Giho] Hi.

42:50.442 --> 42:51.819
Really? Okay.

42:52.403 --> 42:54.071
Hey. Will you tell him I'll call him?

42:54.154 --> 42:55.155
Thanks.

42:55.239 --> 42:57.825
[car door opens, closes]

42:57.908 --> 42:59.910
[engine revving]

43:08.168 --> 43:11.422
[cell phone vibrating]

43:14.592 --> 43:15.634
[Pildo] Where are you?

43:16.385 --> 43:17.344
At home.

43:17.428 --> 43:18.762
[Pildo] Come to Dongcheon's gym.

43:20.764 --> 43:23.058
[somber music]

43:23.142 --> 43:26.353
[machine whirring]

43:36.238 --> 43:37.656
[camera shutter clicks]

43:37.740 --> 43:41.577
♪ Oh, my past look so blurry ♪

43:41.660 --> 43:43.621
[whirring]

43:43.704 --> 43:46.915
♪ Nobody ♪

43:47.416 --> 43:51.420
♪ No one is safe ♪

43:52.171 --> 43:56.884
♪ Oh, my plan is here now ♪

43:58.844 --> 44:01.472
[sirens wailing]

44:03.974 --> 44:05.934
[pants]

44:10.648 --> 44:12.191
[Daesoo] You need to get to a hospital.

44:16.654 --> 44:17.780
Stand up straight.

44:17.863 --> 44:21.116
How could you not see who attacked?
Are you kidding me?

44:21.200 --> 44:22.076
Go in.

44:23.994 --> 44:25.079
Jung Taeju.

44:26.121 --> 44:27.414
You really won't talk?

44:28.123 --> 44:29.041
Hmm?

44:31.710 --> 44:32.586
[sighs]

44:34.004 --> 44:35.172
[exhales deeply]

44:35.255 --> 44:36.924
[clicks tongue]

44:37.841 --> 44:43.138
♪ Oh-whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa ♪

44:45.557 --> 44:47.351
I'M BACK

44:47.434 --> 44:49.103
[Pildo] I don't know who it was,

44:49.687 --> 44:51.605
but someone wrecked Dongcheon's muscle.

44:52.981 --> 44:55.067
Three died
and one is in critical condition.

44:57.486 --> 44:58.612
Do they kill Choi Mujin?

44:59.947 --> 45:03.409
♪ Nobody ♪

45:03.492 --> 45:07.746
♪ No one is safe ♪

45:08.288 --> 45:13.377
♪ Oh, my fear is here now ♪

45:15.003 --> 45:18.716
♪ Because I'm only ♪

45:18.799 --> 45:23.303
♪ Bothered ♪

45:31.103 --> 45:34.565
[rapping in Korean]
